Columns from SeoOrgFields (abstract): struct_org_type, struct_org_name, struct_org_logo_id, struct_org_image_id, struct_org_phone, struct_org_address_street, struct_org_address_locality, struct_org_address_region, struct_org_address_postal, struct_org_address_country, struct_org_geo_lat, struct_org_geo_lng, struct_org_hours, struct_org_actions, struct_org_extra_json.

